{"qid": "mt_00066_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0066", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 13989.0, "n_tokens": 210, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.35, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 315, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.35", "answer": "根据你补充的情况（2018年登记结婚、育有一子、因性格不合长期分居、一方起诉离婚并主张直接抚养子女、另一方主张分割婚后共同购置的房产），回答如下：\n\n**一、是否准予离婚**\n\n《民法典》第一千零七十九条规定：人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；感情确已破裂、调解无效的，应当准予离婚。该条同时规定，因感情不和分居满二年，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n你所述“长期分居”若能达到**因感情不和分居满二年**，且调解无效，属于法定应当准予离婚的情形之一。需注意：分居须是**因感情不和**导致，且为**连续分居满两年**，因工作、学习等客观原因分居一般不计入。\n\n**二、子女抚养**\n\n《民法典》第一千零八十四条规定：离婚后，不满", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 13.988, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪02民再2640号_0", "score": 0.6857, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪02民再2640号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.6721, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤03民终1650号_0", "score": 0.6721, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤03民终1650号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民终665号_0", "score": 0.669, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）津02民终665号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪02民再2610号_0", "score": 0.669, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪02民再2610号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民初1337号_0", "score": 0.665, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民初1337号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民终2135号_0", "score": 0.665, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民终2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民初2501号_0", "score": 0.665, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民初2501号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00031_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0031", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.25, "n_tokens": 234, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.48, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 351, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.48", "answer": "您的问题涉及两个层面，分别说明如下。\n\n## 一、协商一致解除时的经济补偿规则\n\n根据《劳动合同法》第四十六条，用人单位与劳动者**协商一致解除劳动合同**（由用人单位提出动议的），用人单位应当支付经济补偿。计算规则如下：\n\n**1. 计算年限（《劳动合同法》第四十七条第一款）**\n- 按劳动者在本单位工作的年限，每满一年支付一个月工资；\n- 六个月以上不满一年的，按一年计算；\n- 不满六个月的，支付半个月工资。\n\n**2. 计算基数与\"三倍封顶\"（《劳动合同法》第四十七条第二款）**\n- 劳动者月工资高于用人单位所在直辖市、设区的市级人民政府公布的本地区上年度职工月平均工资**三倍**的，经济补偿的标准按职工月平均工资**三倍**的数额支付；\n- 支付年限**最高不超过十二年**。\n\n即：月", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民再2753号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民再2753号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民再1832号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民再1832号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民初1083号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民初1083号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）粤03民初2133号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）粤03民初2133号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）渝01民初2670号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）渝01民初2670号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民终2542号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民终2542号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）渝01民再2307号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）渝01民再2307号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）鲁01民终238号_0", "score": 0.0789, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）鲁01民终238号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00039_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0039", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 43.06, "n_tokens": 238, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.32, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 357, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.32", "answer": "您的问题涉及两个不同法律问题，需分开说明：\n\n**一、加班费规则（承接 g0039）**\n\n参考资料中未包含加班费的具体法律条文，我无法依据现有资料给出准确条号。一般而言，加班费主张涉及《劳动法》第四十四条及《最高人民法院关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）》第四十二条（举证责任分配），但**上述条文未在本次参考资料中提供，我不能确认其准确内容，建议另行核实**。\n\n就您描述的情形（用人单位提供考勤记录、未就加班审批流程举证），参考资料中的裁判观点仅涉及未签书面劳动合同二倍工资及违法解除的举证责任，**并未涉及加班费**，故不能直接套用。\n\n**二、工伤问题**\n\n工伤与加班费是两个独立的法律问题，前述加班费的规则**不适用于工伤认定**。参考资料中亦**未包含工伤认定、工伤保险待遇的任何法条**", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.042, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1179", "score": 0.6347, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1179, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民终1893号_0", "score": 0.1733, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民终1893号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民终1908号_0", "score": 0.1663, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民终1908号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）闽01民再737号_0", "score": 0.1662, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）闽01民再737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民终1939号_0", "score": 0.1646, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民终1939号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民再1832号_0", "score": 0.1646, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民再1832号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再395号_0", "score": 0.1645, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再395号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）闽01民再1721号_0", "score": 0.1594, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）闽01民再1721号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00010_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0010", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 36.61, "n_tokens": 218, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.4211, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 327, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.42", "answer": "关于利息，需区分约定利息与逾期利息，分别说明如下：\n\n**一、约定利息（借期内利息）**\n\n《民法典》第六百八十条第一款规定：禁止高利放贷，借款的利率不得违反国家有关规定。\n\n具体上限标准，依据《最高人民法院关于审理民间借贷案件适用法律若干问题的规定》（2020年修正）第二十五条：出借人请求借款人按照合同约定利率支付利息的，人民法院应予支持，但是双方约定的利率超过合同成立时一年期贷款市场报价利率（LPR）四倍的除外。\n\n你所述月利率1%，折合年利率12%。是否超过四倍LPR，需以**借条成立时**的一年期LPR为准判断（例如LPR为3.45%时，四倍为13.8%，则12%未超上限）。参考资料中多份判决亦载明\"出借人主张的利率不得违反国家有关规定，", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.035, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2114号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2114号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏05民再1869号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏05民再1869号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民终1270号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）鲁01民终1270号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民再1226号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民再1226号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民再1799号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民再1799号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）粤03民终2938号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）粤03民终2938号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）粤03民终2941号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）粤03民终2941号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2556号_1", "score": 0.0714, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2556号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00074_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0074", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.16, "n_tokens": 234, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.25, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 352, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.25", "answer": "关于彩礼问题，需先说明：**您提供的参考资料中没有任何关于彩礼的法律条文或案例**，因此以下回答只能依据一般法律知识，且部分内容存在不确定性，请以现行有效法律及当地法院实践为准。\n\n**一、彩礼返还的法律依据**\n\n彩礼纠纷主要适用《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉婚姻家庭编的解释（一）》第五条（原《婚姻法》司法解释二第十条）。该条规定，当事人请求返还按照习俗给付的彩礼的，如果查明属于以下情形，人民法院应当予以支持：\n1. 双方未办理结婚登记手续；\n2. 双方办理结婚登记手续但确未共同生活；\n3. 婚前给付并导致给付人生活困难。\n\n适用第2、3项的规定，应当以双方离婚为条件。\n\n**二、与您前面问题的关系**\n\n您前面提到的\"撤回离婚登记申请后另行起诉离婚\"以及\"婚前个人财产不予分割", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_10", "score": 0.6278, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 10, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_收养法_1998修正_6", "score": 0.6239, "type": "provision", "law": "收养法", "article": 6, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京02民终1040号_0", "score": 0.2893, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京02民终1040号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民初1047号_0", "score": 0.2819, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民初1047号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）粤03民再217号_0", "score": 0.2819, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）粤03民再217号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）粤03民再415号_0", "score": 0.275, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）粤03民再415号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）粤01民初1843号_0", "score": 0.275, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）粤01民初1843号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）粤03民再2284号_0", "score": 0.275, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）粤03民再2284号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00020_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0020", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.59, "n_tokens": 225, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.65, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 338, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.65", "answer": "**一、本金能否主张返还**\n\n可以。上述条件（朋友关系、银行转账、无书面合同、未约定利息）不影响本金返还请求权。\n\n依据《民法典》第六百六十七条，借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款、到期返还借款并支付利息的合同；第六百七十五条规定，借款人应当按照约定的期限返还借款。本案虽无书面合同，但银行转账凭证可证明款项实际交付，结合双方陈述可认定借贷合意，借款人应当返还本金。\n\n**二、需要准备的材料**\n\n1. **银行转账凭证**：证明119000元实际交付，是核心证据；\n2. **双方身份信息**：原告、被告的身份证明，用于确定当事人；\n3. **催收记录**：微信、短信、通话录音等，证明借款合意及催告事实，同时可用于确定逾期起算点；\n4. **起诉状**：写明借款事实、金额、", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪02民初398号_0", "score": 0.0857, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪02民初398号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民再667号_0", "score": 0.0857, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民再667号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）津02民初1653号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）津02民初1653号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民初759号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民初759号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民初739号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民初739号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民初2496号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民初2496号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民再3021号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民再3021号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民再3007号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民再3007号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00077_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0077", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.34, "n_tokens": 212, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.5263, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 319, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.53", "answer": "关于您追问的\"提前退租\"问题，需要先说明：您上一轮提到的情形是\"租赁期限届满后未续签书面合同、承租人继续使用并支付租金\"，这与\"提前退租\"（租期未满即退租）是两种不同的法律状态，规则并不相同。以下分别说明。\n\n**一、关于\"期满后继续使用\"的规则（承接上一问题）**\n\n《民法典》第七百三十四条第一款规定：租赁期限届满，承租人继续使用租赁物，出租人没有提出异议的，原租赁合同继续有效，但是租赁期限为不定期。\n\n不定期租赁下，依《民法典》第七百三十条，当事人可以随时解除合同，但应当在合理期限之前通知对方。因此出租人拟收回房屋，需提前合理期限通知；承租人主张的\"优先承租权\"，依《民法典》第七百三十四条第二款，是指租赁期限届满后，房屋承租人", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）粤01民再2744号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）粤01民再2744号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）津02民终2407号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）津02民终2407号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）闽01民再747号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）闽01民再747号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏01民初1075号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏01民初1075号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏01民初2507号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏01民初2507号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）粤01民再2719号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）粤01民再2719号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民再2502号_0", "score": 0.0811, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民再2502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再445号_0", "score": 0.0811, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再445号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00058_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0058", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.12, "n_tokens": 232, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.45, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 349, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.45", "answer": "根据你补充的情况（以感情确已破裂为由起诉离婚、主张对方家庭暴力、请求损害赔偿并在财产分割中予以照顾），相关规则和材料如下：\n\n**一、是否适用**\n\n适用。你所述情形属于诉讼离婚，仍适用《民法典》第一千零七十九条的规则：\n\n- 人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；感情确已破裂、调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n- 存在家庭暴力情形，属于法律明确列举的、调解无效应准予离婚的法定情形之一。\n\n**二、损害赔偿与财产分割**\n\n- 《民法典》第一千零九十一条规定：因家庭暴力导致离婚的，无过错方有权请求损害赔偿。\n- 《民法典》第一千零八十七条规定：离婚时夫妻共同财产由双方协议处理；协议不成的，由人民法院根据财产的具体情况，按照照顾子女、女方和无过错方权益的原则判决。\n\n**三、需要准备的材料**\n\n1", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪02民再2640号_0", "score": 0.6764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪02民再2640号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪02民终1518号_0", "score": 0.6738, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪02民终1518号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.67, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民终2135号_0", "score": 0.67, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民终2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民初2501号_0", "score": 0.67, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民初2501号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2148号_0", "score": 0.6679, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2148号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2571号_0", "score": 0.6679, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2571号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_0", "score": 0.6679, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00033_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0033", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.33, "n_tokens": 246, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 370, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.40", "answer": "关于您提到的\"裁员\"（即用人单位单方解除劳动合同）问题，结合您描述的情形，分述如下：\n\n**一、法律规则**\n\n1. **解除的合法性及举证责任**\n   用人单位主张系合法解除（如以劳动者严重违反规章制度为由），应当就解除的法定事由承担举证责任。若未能提交充分证据证明劳动者存在严重违反规章制度的事实，应承担举证不能的不利后果，即可能被认定为违法解除。\n\n2. **违法解除的后果**\n   依据《劳动合同法》第四十八条、第八十七条，用人单位违法解除劳动合同的，劳动者可以要求继续履行合同，或者要求用人单位按经济补偿标准的**二倍**支付赔偿金。\n\n3. **经济补偿标准**\n   依据《劳动合同法》第四十七条，经济补偿按劳动者在本单位工作的年限，每满一年支付一个月工资；六个月以上不满一年的，按一年计算；不满六个月的，支付半个月工资。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1629号_0", "score": 0.0643, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1629号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民再1283号_0", "score": 0.0643, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）浙01民再1283号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）苏05民初2749号_0", "score": 0.0571, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）苏05民初2749号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2419号_0", "score": 0.0571, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2419号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏01民再1591号_0", "score": 0.0571, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏01民再1591号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民再2753号_0", "score": 0.05, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民再2753号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民初1083号_0", "score": 0.05, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民初1083号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再395号_0", "score": 0.05, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再395号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00097_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0097", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.38, "n_tokens": 228, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.3158, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 343, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.32", "answer": "关于您追问的“提前退租”情形，结合您补充的条件（租期两年、因工作调动提前退租、要求退还押金、涉案金额约247000元、距今约64个月），说明如下：\n\n**一、法律规则**\n\n1. **合同解除与违约责任**\n《民法典》第五百七十七条规定：当事人一方不履行合同义务或者履行合同义务不符合约定的，应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任。\n《民法典》第五百八十四条规定：损失赔偿额应当相当于因违约所造成的损失，包括合同履行后可以获得的利益，但不得超过违约一方订立合同时预见到或者应当预见到的因违约可能造成的损失。\n\n2. **押金的性质与返还**\n押金（保证金）主要起担保作用，用于抵扣承租人欠付租金、造成的损失等。若承租人提前退租构成违约，出租人可主张从押金中扣除相应损失；但", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.041, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再671号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再671号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京02民初1700号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京02民初1700号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民初2078号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民初2078号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民初1956号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民初1956号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民再1963号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民再1963号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪02民终2849号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪02民终2849号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民终931号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民终931号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民终1928号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民终1928号"}]}}}
